nd a different set (1269, 1415, 1460) show high degree and many events. Neighbor lists confirm 728 had many specific partners earlier (step_06) and none in the later window (step_07); conversely 1415 had no neighbors earlier (step_08) but is active later. Total event volume across the broader period stays comparable (steps_01 and _03), so the effect is not a simple change in overall activity but an abrupt switch in partner sets consistent with a regime shift.\"\n}", "total_input_tokens": 20919, "total_output_tokens": 6932, "total_tokens": 27851, "total_latency_ms": 74438, "llm_calls": 10, "schema_repairs": 0, "status": "success", "error": ""}